              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): তিনি পঞ্চাশ বছরে অবসর নিলেন, tini pônchāsh bôchhôre ôbôsôr nilen."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "অবসর alone is free time: অবসরে, in one's spare time."
            }
          ]
        },
